I"?<h1 id="live-acoustic-neural-harmonizer">Live Acoustic Neural Harmonizer</h1>

<p>When creating musical ideas, it is often hard to concepualize the full scope of harmonies and rhythms when working by oneself. Having new background ideas availble in real-time greatly expands the freedom and flexibility musicians have when demoing and/or tinkering with ideas, even with just a single instrument or voice. The goal of this project was to create a real-time system that could take live audio signal from any instrument and generate real-time harmonies played through MIDI.</p>
